Another (admittedly more expensive) direction to think of would be to
decrease the overall worth of reflection. Currently, it seems that MR +
reflection makes you pretty much invulnerable except to phyisical
attacks and "few other things". Regardless whether the player obtains
reflection at sokoban or some time later, he will find himself being
bored later in the game, because he will either die of those "few other
things" or not at all.

I don't think I'm looking for more instadeaths now. Perhaps more enemies
where logical behaviour would help avoid deaths (like cockatrices, slow
monsters, semicolons..). Another alternative would be to give the
amulets a non-100% reflecting ability...

